[{"sha":"a07c8ebd57feedc4cf5dfe854c8e9101de54186b","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKGEwN2M4ZWJkNTdmZWVkYzRjZjVkZmU4NTRjOGU5MTAxZGU1NDE4NmI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Felipe Coury","email":"felipe.coury@openai.com","date":"2026-10-11T12:29:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"copyberry","email":"copyberry@app.openai.com","date":"2026-10-11T12:38:29Z"},"message":"Handle broken pipes gracefully in plugin list output (#53109)\n\n## Why\n\nPiping `codex plugin list` into a consumer such as `head` can close stdout before the full catalog is written, causing a panic.\n\n## What changed\n\nWrite both table and JSON output through a fallible writer and treat broken pipes during writing or flushing as success. Continue propagating other output errors.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdd unit tests for write and flush failures in both output formats, plus CLI tests that close stdout early and verify a successful exit without a panic.\n\nGitOrigin-RevId: cc4a64e10ad723d26b6de9e731efdc534dbee492","tree":{"sha":"f4b946b4e7c0f9eaa6be860aeeb9328b3420603c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/f4b946b4e7c0f9eaa6be860aeeb9328b3420603c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/a07c8ebd57feedc4cf5dfe854c8e9101de54186b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/a07c8ebd57feedc4cf5dfe854c8e9101de54186b","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/a07c8ebd57feedc4cf5dfe854c8e9101de54186b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/a07c8ebd57feedc4cf5dfe854c8e9101de54186b/comments","author":{"login":"fcoury-oai","id":272635208,"node_id":"U_kgDOEEAVSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/272635208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fcoury-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/fcoury-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fcoury-oai/followers","following_url":"htt